{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_033_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a91018fda61fd58a8010aaea7c027eb6dbaa6181d6d8ad1f72522d33e05c2138",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858f74a714447dfcd985af73f3dca4816599fadfbcfbe392cd1949a157a54290",
      "text": "我突然想去趟便利店了～。\n哎呀，想吃点零食嘛～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:352c853700df4b6934be9646b9a2dc2a4c3b0f461e20e34976e070e5ab08c23b",
      "text": "吃什么好呢，超纠结的～！\n回来可能会花点时间哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706376129b1d31a86b26d0c9a369d2a638b0c149278dda2e0d25798065b68805",
      "text": "那么，就是这样啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:651b81fa4228d97dcab2fdf14bca0c7919a17e966c4676e301eb817835bc3511",
      "text": "（才怪呢！\n趁我不在，你们终于要聊那个话题了吧？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9bda1e098c45fba860e3840d9ad31028c2da87b728dc78f409dc7043a9301cf",
      "text": "（不管是花音的生日还是直央的生日，大家都是\n为了不暴露而悄悄准备的嘛……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d791b635fa6a50d98a1b0a8b129a51fd29d1556488c4333f495aeba0ed4b8682",
      "text": "（我的生日肯定也会这么干的！\n嘿嘿，自以为很保密，可惜落空啦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1485f0da60225e2c38ddf36e8f3c976a34a055e62589d1ebdbd9c99197a1e044",
      "text": "（志狼大人我可是道高一尺魔高一丈。\n你们的计划，我就好好听个够吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0603476e2373a8d4d00d1e90f6019153869d27d91c01e043bb21b56381291964",
      "text": "那个，制作人。\n算术的这道题有点难……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31f9f0962f0c6239fb96b7af5a61dbefae79b9911f873f470b153ad3a5a6632",
      "text": "呐呐，能给一点点提示吗♪\n花音感觉就差一点点就能解出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:722c5a0274048edff42f0d670b3cf09e020413d9c021ba626f11e7f0c3ce3640",
      "text": "你们两个认真写作业真了不起呢。\n这道题是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fba174c207a10ac1a0d2f311d52e89e0a6793d05e89715257b8cb7dfa68817d",
      "text": "什……！？居然还在正常写作业啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_033shr_02_1_2_033_02:1_2_033_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a062759438736202c034c742b3a57b84c50114bd0714a4493337cf0f78a148e",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，这群家伙……\n真无聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
